{"text":"比丘静度願造釋加像一區，并造兩觀世音，別造小觀世一勘，仰爲所生七世師僧父母及一切衆生共同此福。普泰二年閏月廿日造。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"静度","refId":null,"text":"静度","start":2,"end":4},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋加","start":6,"end":8},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"觀世音","refId":null,"text":"觀世音","start":15,"end":18},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"觀世音","refId":null,"text":"觀世","start":22,"end":24},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"衆生","start":40,"end":42}]}